# Cloudflare Pages redirects (served from repo root — pages_build_output_dir = ".")
#
# The admin review page was renamed admin.html -> goldenpath.html to make it
# less discoverable. These rules make sure the old /admin URL is never a way
# back into it: any lingering request (including a stale edge-cached one, or a
# bookmark someone kept) is redirected to the home page instead of exposing an
# admin page. The redirect is evaluated by Pages routing ahead of static-asset
# serving, so it takes effect even if an old admin.html were ever still around.
/admin        /  301
/admin.html   /  301
/admin/*      /  301

# The National Overview page was renamed constituency-map.html -> overview.html
# (URL /constituency-map -> /overview). Keep the old paths working for anyone
# with a bookmark or an external link to the previous URL.
/constituency-map        /overview  301
/constituency-map.html   /overview  301
